ata-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="7ac2fe6f-04f3-4351-b55b-5a7df634e2c7"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">可以！而且你说得对，我前面一直让你等文件生成工具，确实绕远了。</span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">我们完全可以直接在 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">GitHub </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">网页上编辑代码，不需要等我生成文件，也不需要安装软件。</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你现在已经有一个仓库，也已经打开了 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">的编辑页面。我们就从这里继续。</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">第一步：先把网页做出来</span></h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你现在应该能看到一个文件名输入框，以及下面的代码编辑区。</span></p><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">确认文件名是 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">。</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">点击下面的代码编辑区。</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">如果里面有内容，先全选并替换；如果是空白，就直接粘贴下面这份代码。</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">这是一版可以直接运行的海洋主题主页，先用海洋渐变背景和导航卡片搭好结构，之后再加上你喜欢的真实流动海浪视频。</span></p><div><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] frame-aD2tvA editorControls-fA0_fZ z-10 clear-both my-4 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:my-0 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overflow-y-auto in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overscroll-contain in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:scrollbar-none [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--codex-base-accent,var(--color-text-info,var(--color-text)))] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-primary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-info-solid,var(--color-text-inverse,#fff))] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="```html
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;
&lt;title&gt;潮汐之间 · 我的主页&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  color: #f4f4ef;
  font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 20%, #b99562 0%, transparent 25%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #244e66, #0a2d46 55%, #061725);
}

header {
  padding: 26px 7%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff30;
}

header a {
  color: #e5d3b0;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 20px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.hero {
  padding: 100px 7% 90px;
  min-height: 62vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
}

.label {
  color: #e5c994;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(44px, 8vw, 88px);
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 25px 0 12px;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #e8d8ba;
}

.intro {
  max-width: 480px;
  color: #d5e0e5;
  line-height: 2;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin: 22px 0 30px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  width: fit-content;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  color: #102c3c;
  background: #e5c994;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.links {
  padding: 30px 7% 80px;
}

.links h2 {
  font-size: 26px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 15px;
}

.card {
  padding: 24px;
  min-height: 135px;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  background: #061c2bbd;
  border: 1px solid #ffffff30;
  transition: .2s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  border-color: #e5c994;
}

.card h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.card p {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #c2d0d8;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

footer {
  padding: 25px 7%;
  color: #b6c5cc;
  font-size: 11px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff30;
}

@media (max-width: 650px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero { padding-top: 75px; }
  header { padding: 22px 5%; }
  header a { margin-left: 8px; }
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;

&lt;body&gt;
&lt;header&gt;
  &lt;span&gt;BETWEEN TIDES&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;nav&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;#about&quot;&gt;关于&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;#links&quot;&gt;导航&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;

&lt;main&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;hero&quot; id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;A SMALL PLACE OF MY OWN&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;h1&gt;潮汐之间&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;在广阔世界里，慢慢成为自己。&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;intro&quot;&gt;
    这里收藏常去的地方、正在学习的事，
    以及那些值得停留片刻的灵感。
    海浪来去，而好奇心继续向前。
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;a class=&quot;btn&quot; href=&quot;#links&quot;&gt;探索我的世界 ↗&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;links&quot; id=&quot;links&quot;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;PERSONAL COMPASS&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;把常去的地方，放在这里。&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nju.edu.cn/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;南京大学 ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;校园主页 · 学习与生活&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;GitHub ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;代码、项目与创造&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://www.bilibili.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;学习与灵感 ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;课程、视频和有趣的发现&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;科学世界 ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;生命、智能与未知的问题&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://scholar.google.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;学术探索 ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;论文、研究与新想法&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a class=&quot;card&quot; href=&quot;https://outlook.live.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;
      &lt;h3&gt;邮箱 ↗&lt;/h3&gt;
      &lt;p&gt;整理消息与日常事务&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;

&lt;footer&gt;BETWEEN TIDES · PERSONAL HOMEPAGE&lt;/footer&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
```" data-testid="chatgpt-writing-block" data-writing-block-variant="document" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px