ta-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">③ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">设置发布来源</span></h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">在 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Build </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">and </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">deployment</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">区域设置：</span></p><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Source</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">选择发布方式</span></p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-weight="medium"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Deploy </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">from </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">a </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">branch</span></p></div><div class="Divider-WkGDyu" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Branch</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">选择网页代码所在分支</span></p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-weight="medium"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">main</span></p></div><div class="Divider-WkGDyu" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Folder</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="sm" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">选择文件所在目录</span></p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-weight="medium"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">/(root)</span></p></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">最后点击 </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Save</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">。</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">④ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">等待网站发布</span></h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">等一两分钟，刷新 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Pages </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">页面，找到显示的网址，通常是：</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">https://你的用户名.github.io/仓库名/</span></code></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">如果仓库名称本身是 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你的用户名.github.io</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，网址格式会略有不同。</span></p><div class="Divider-WkGDyu" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你先完成这一步。</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">如果出现网站网址，直接把它发给我，我就能根据你实际发布的页面继续指导你。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">如果没看到网址，也可以截一张 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Pages </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">设置页面给我，我们一起检查。下一步就是给海面加上真正流动的金色阳光和海浪。</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="复制" data-state="