Base-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">完成后，你的仓库里应该同时有 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">和 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">ocean.mp4</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">。</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">③ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">让网页播放视频</span></h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">打开 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，点击编辑按钮，找到原来背景颜色的 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">CSS </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">代码。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">先不要急着删代码。</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你把当前 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">的编辑页面截图发给我，或者把代码复制过来，我会准确告诉你该替换哪一部分，避免把已经做好的主页弄坏。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">视频背景一般通过 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">HTML </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">的 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">&lt;video </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">autoplay </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">muted </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">loop </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">playsinline&gt;</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">实现：静音自动播放，并在结束后循环。</span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline=""><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="button" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-d-stream-inline=""><span class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="secondary" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-hoverable="" data-d-weight="normal" style="--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1.5); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); padding-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); padding-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); padding-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1.5); padding-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); max-width: 100px; background-color: var(--gray-400); height: auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="flex: 0 0 auto;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G FaviconBox-a4uDs_" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="favicon" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" role="presentation" style="flex-shrink: 0; height: 12px; width: 12px;"><img class="Image-LDLXtM Image-Tq_How" draggable="false" src="./ocean_files/favicons" data-loaded=""></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="flex: 0 1 auto; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0.75); min-width: 0px;"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0px;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="3xs" data-d-inline="" data-d-truncate="true" data-d-clamp-lines="true" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); -webkit-line-clamp: 1;"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">MDN</span></span></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="3xs" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">+1</span></span></div></div></div></span></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">我们一步一步来，先完成视频上传。</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cu