 24" fill="currentColor" data-d-component="icon" style="font-size: 24px;"><path d="M9.83357 5C9.0972 5 8.50024 5.59695 8.50024 6.33333C8.50024 7.06971 9.0972 7.66667 9.83357 7.66667C10.57 7.66667 11.1669 7.06971 11.1669 6.33333C11.1669 5.59695 10.57 5 9.83357 5ZM6.50024 6.33333C6.50024 4.49238 7.99263 3 9.83357 3C11.6745 3 13.1669 4.49238 13.1669 6.33333C13.1669 8.17428 11.6745 9.66667 9.83357 9.66667C7.99263 9.66667 6.50024 8.17428 6.50024 6.33333ZM13.3793 11.4215C14.3771 9.89157 16.6253 9.91327 17.5933 11.4622L20.6857 16.41C21.9346 18.4081 20.4981 21 18.1417 21H5.78797C3.24001 21 1.85205 18.0244 3.4894 16.0722L6.21761 12.8193C7.13833 11.7215 8.79145 11.6206 9.83889 12.5982L11.3452 14.0041C11.4587 14.11 11.6403 14.0879 11.7252 13.9579L13.3793 11.4215ZM15.8973 12.5222C15.7037 12.2124 15.2541 12.208 15.0545 12.514L13.4004 15.0504C12.6369 16.221 11.0022 16.4197 9.98054 15.4662L8.47425 14.0603C8.26476 13.8648 7.93414 13.885 7.75 14.1045L5.02178 17.3574C4.476 18.0081 4.93866 19 5.78797 19H18.1417C18.9272 19 19.406 18.136 18.9897 17.47L15.8973 12.5222Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">2. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">上传到你的仓库</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">打开 </span><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://github.com/xsj31/senjianxiao-nju-direction?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">你的 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">GitHub </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">仓库</span></span><span class="ms-1" data-d-stream-inline=""><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，点击 </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Add </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">file </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">→ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Upload </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">files</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，选择 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">ocean.jpg</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，再点击 </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Commit </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">changes</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">。</span></p></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">第二步：让网页使用这张图片</span></h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">上传完成后，打开仓库里的 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，点击铅笔图标编辑。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">在 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">&lt;style&gt;</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">和 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">&lt;/style&gt;</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">之间找到原来的 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">body </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">{ </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">... </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">}</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">样式，把其中的 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">background: </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">...;</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">替换成：</span></p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-c6b5375eadec3cee.svg#codex-icon-code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate">CSS</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="启用自动换行" aria-pressed="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-c6b5375eadec3cee.svg#codex-icon-text-overflow-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="复制代码" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-c6b5375eadec3cee.svg#codex-icon-square-on-square-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="InlineCodePane-EYx4bd w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full Viewer-ALA646" dir="ltr"><div class="chatgpt-code-scrollport flex w-full items-stretch overscroll-x-contain Scrollport-kY3Nlm overflow-x-auto"><pre class="m-0 flex-1 cursor-text px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">background</span><span>:
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">linear-gradient</span><span>(
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">90deg</span><span>,
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">3</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">16</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">28</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.65</span><span>),
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">3</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">16</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">28</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.18</span><span>)
  ),
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">linear-gradient</span><span>(
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0deg</span><span>,
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">3</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">16</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">28</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.45</span><span>),
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">transparent 70%</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">  </span><span>),
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">url</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"./ocean.jpg"</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center center </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">/ </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">cover no-repeat fixed</span><span>;</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="滚动到底部" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-c6b5375eadec3cee.svg#codex-icon-arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">这会让图片铺满屏幕，并叠加一层深色渐变，避免白色文字和导航卡片被浪花干扰。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">注意：</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">如果原来的 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">body</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">里还有其他 </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">CSS </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">属性，比如 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">color</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">、</span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">font-family</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">、</span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">margin</span></code><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，都保留，只替换 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">background</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">那一项。</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">最后点击 </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Commit </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">changes</span></span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">，等待几十秒，再刷新你的主页：</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://xsj31.github.io/senjianxiao-nju-direction/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">打开我的主页</span></span><span class="ms-1" data-d-stream-inline=""><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">先完成图片上传。如果你打开 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">index.html</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">后找不到 </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">body</span></code> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">那一段，直接把编辑页面截图发给我，我告诉你具体改哪一行。</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.