,\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**③ 点击 Create repository**\\n\\n创建完成后，你就有了一个存放个人主页的仓库。\\n\\n注意：仓库公开意味着网页源代码也会公开，所以不要在里面放密码、私人信息或不想公开的文件。\\n\\n**你先做到这里，然后告诉我仓库创建成功了没有。** 下一步我会给你准备好完整的海洋主题网页文件，再带你上传、发布，让它真正变成一个可以访问的网址。\",\"fallbackMarkdownVersion\",\"requiredComponents\",[395,459],\"appData\",{\"_378\":379},\"opGenui\",{\"_380\":381,\"_382\":383,\"_384\":385},\"componentResults\",{\"_360\":386,\"_352\":387,\"_341\":388,\"_324\":389},\"interactionSurface\",\"mainline\",\"modelDataBindings\",{},{\"_34\":390,\"_391\":471,\"_55\":472,\"_394\":395},{\"_34\":390,\"_391\":457,\"_55\":458,\"_394\":459},{\"_34\":390,\"_391\":443,\"_55\":444,\"_394\":395},{\"_34\":390,\"_391\":392,\"_55\":393,\"_394\":395},\"resolved\",\"state\",{\"_396\":333,\"_397\":398,\"_399\":335,\"_400\":60,\"_401\":-5,\"_402\":403,\"_404\":11,\"_405\":406,\"_407\":11,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":-5},[301,303,308],\"componentName\",\"AsyncImage\",\"frame_aspect_ratio\",\"frame_width\",\"100%\",\"frame_max_width\",\"frame_height\",\"max_height\",\"presentation\",{\"_437\":438,\"_439\":-5,\"_440\":441,\"_442\":20},\"has_fallback\",\"image_fit\",\"cover\",\"is_loading\",\"images\",[411],\"default_on_click_action\",{\"_331\":301,\"_412\":303,\"_413\":308,\"_414\":415,\"_416\":417,\"_39\":418,\"_419\":20,\"_420\":421,\"_422\":423,\"_424\":425,\"_426\":11},\"content_url\",\"thumbnail_url\",\"original_content_url\",\"https://eecs130.github.io/spring2020/assets/images/tutorials/tutorial02/image1.png\",\"save_target\",\"image\",\"Getting Started with GitHub\",\"show_url\",\"content_size\",{\"_431\":435,\"_433\":436},\"thumbnail_size\",{\"_431\":432,\"_433\":434},\"thumbnail_crop_info\",{\"_427\":428,\"_429\":430},\"shop_eligible\",\"center_x_percent\",0.16841415465268678,\"center_y_percent\",0.075,\"width\",1025,\"height\",860,1526,1280,\"min_width\",\"0px\",\"min_height\",\"radius\",\"xl\",\"frame\",{\"_396\":333,\"_397\":398,\"_399\":335,\"_400\":60,\"_40